WEBVTT

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.490
Reishin truly loved Kuro-chan.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.200
Brother...

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.260
Gods

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.550
do not perish!

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.390
Undying.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.560
We are eternal.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:41.890
Due to fate.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:44.020
What the heck is that?!

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:47.400
Didn't the Masagami lose its ability to regenerate?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.270
That is not regeneration.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:54.740
Most likely, in an attempt to escape destruction, they have fused with each other's Tera and taken that twisted form.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:57.110
This is the first frame of the OP.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:31.710
"Fate"

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.120
We are ever unchanging.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.130
The three of us are one.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.130
God is forever.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.380
God is all and one.

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.130
God reigns

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.340
and God presides over all.

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:43.100
Gods don't cast curses on people!

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.640
We will defeat you and destroy the Doppeliner system!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.890
May judgment befall you.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:55.150
Exceed, Gigaexe!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.190
W-What's happening?

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:05.720
This is terrible.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.220
The Sacred Precincts are...

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.430
Where are Kuro and the Masagami?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.020
Kuro!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.280
Go!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.150
Keita-san, thank you!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.290
This is our very last battle.

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:40.800
Kuro, who came to this world alone and never once ran away, stood against everything...

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:46.800
Despite being forcefully dragged into a contract, Keita-san has always supported me.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:49.220
Through you, I have learned that

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.560
fate can be overcome.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.350
With a heart as strong as Keita-san's...

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.640
We will...

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.060
stand against fate!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:04.570
We are forever unchanging.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.290
W-What?

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.540
We three shall become one.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:24.550
Keita-kun!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.050
The Masagami is absorbing her Tera?

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:34.140
Keita-kun!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:40.060
At this rate... All of our Tera will be drained... by the Masagami...

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.190
The time for three

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.570
to become one has come.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.070
Three as one?

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.910
If they can absorb her Tera... Could it be that...

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:54.620
Huh?

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.830
Keita-kun, the Thousands!

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.750
We will again

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.590
become one.

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:03.000
We shall rightfully

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.090
rule over this world.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.600
Are you alright?

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.350
Receive your judgment!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.110
Are they activating a synchro through the power of the Thousands?

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.150
Keita-kun, give my Tera to Kuro-chan.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:33.620
Akane-san's enormous Tera is flowing into me.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.870
It's not just the Tera...

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.210
Their feelings are also flowing in.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.380
I'll destroy fate!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:06:59.890
Kuro, now!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:11.030
Exceed, Teraexe!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.990
Three as one.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.410
Forever unchanging.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.800
I give this Tera back to everyone.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:54.280
The Sacred Precincts are...

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.740
Brother...

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.540
Does this mean it's finally over?

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:15.470
People attributed everything to a natural disaster.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:19.850
Without knowing the existence of the Sacred Precincts or the Masagami,

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:23.600
the world is once again starting to move.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.740
Hey, Kuro.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:40.330
Good morning, Keita-san.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.620
I'm sorry, but I got too hungry.

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.510
Gramps, what time is your flight?

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.260
You know, it's okay if you don't see me off.

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:01.140
Akane-san said she'll drive you there.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:03.600
I see. If so, then...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.360
Good morning, Keita-kun.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.190
Sorry for troubling you, Akane-san.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.530
Good morning, Punipuni.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:19.780
Let's eat!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.870
Take care of yourself when you get back to Okinawa, Makana.

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.540
I'll be okay.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.370
Not to mention Gramps will be there...

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.790
You're free to stay at my place whenever you want.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:32.300
Thank you.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.180
Seconds!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.260
Coming.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.050
Seconds.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:45.020
I am definitely grateful of the fact that she helped us during our fight with the Masagami.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.520
However, how much longer does she plan on freeloading here?

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:52.730
Namu-san, would you like me to get you a larger portion as well?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.610
Yes.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.490
Akane-san, you know...

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.780
Stay with us for as long as you want.

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:58.530
Huh?

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.070
I appreciate your sincere offer.

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:02.870
Ah, Yakumo-kun.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.370
I'll do it. You should go and eat.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:08.580
I'm essentially a freeloader, so I should at least do this much.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.500
Is it okay for you to not go back?

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.420
There are still things I need to record.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.420
Huh?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.880
What do you mean?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.110
Good day to you.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.110
Yakumo, are Kuro and the others here?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:43.120
They are all heading to the airport to see Grandpa and the others off.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:47.620
Man, right after I went and bought some Joyjoys.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.870
Ah!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:55.590
Bringing gifts is an excellent display of one's good character.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.300
I am extremely delighted!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:01.050
Hey, you! Thief!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.140
Oh my.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.560
It's going to become lonely.

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:16.610
I think we're already lively enough.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:22.700
Would it be better if I also returned to the Sacred Precincts?

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:23.910
Nah.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.160
I have no problems with you staying.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.030
Eh?

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:29.410
If you go back, you won't get to eat ramen anymore.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.330
Right!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.670
It's from Excel-chan.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.220
What is it?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.220
Huh? She says she's going back to Germany.

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.430
Eh?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.180
Can nothing be done about this bumpy ride?

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.650
You're free to get out and walk.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:56.650
If it were up to me, there would be a nice, handsome guy sitting where you are.

00:11:57.360 --> 00:11:59.190
I share your opinion.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.530
Is it all right for us to just go like this?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.120
What are you implying?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.950
I am sure you feel it.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.450
There's still...

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.500
They are the ones who defeated the Masagami.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.540
Let us leave the decision to them.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:26.970
That is fine, right, Steiner?

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.730
I wouldn't have minded making dinner.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:41.150
No, tomorrow's your important final interview, right?

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.740
You better prepare well tonight.

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.820
I got it. Thank you, Keita-kun.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.870
Thank you very much.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.750
It looks like Akane-san won't have too much trouble getting re-employed.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.330
That's a relief.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.750
Oh, you're so persistent.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.970
Aren't doppelgangers just an urban legend?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.260
I really did see one. There was a girl who looked just like I did.

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:10.760
Okay, okay. Tell me about it tomorrow.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.270
See you.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.770
Hey, you! Wait!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.030
Keita-san, are you all right?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.040
T-Thank you...

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.500
Seems like it wasn't undone after all.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.550
Why?

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.550
Is the Masagami's curse still lingering on?

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:52.220
It's because I'm alive, isn't it?

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.140
Yes.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:58.770
I returned the Tera that Masagami absorbed back to everyone, but...

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.110
The curse remains inside of me.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:07.400
You realized a while back that there are differences among the amounts of Tera people have, right?

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:13.580
Yes... But to think that the Doppeliner system still existed...

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:17.790
Damn... That means that girl just now...

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.420
In mere moments will...

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.590
If I die, will the system disappear?

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:32.550
It might, unfortunately.

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:37.350
However, if you die, your contractee who is under the Tera Cycle with you...

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.270
Is there no way to only erase the Masagami's curse?

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.480
The curse will not fade.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.620
Brother...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.160
Mother...

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.370
What should I do?

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:07.800
Kuro...

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.720
Keita-san.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:16.640
What is it?

00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:19.140
Do you want to go eat some ramen?

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:22.270
Princess, dinner will be ready soon.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.610
I'm sorry, Yakumo. I suddenly started to crave it.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:32.070
We're off.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.910
Huh? That ramen stand isn't here.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.210
There are tons of other ramen stands around.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:46.590
I wanted to eat the ramen that you treated me to.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.930
One specialty ramen, here you go. I topped it off for you as a treat.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.430
Thank you.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:04.100
It's nothing. The two of you were a big help.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.730
I'm digging in.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:07.400
Hey, doggie!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.240
It's delicious.

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:21.960
I'm really happy that we got to eat this ramen again.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.040
Keita-san.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.000
Hm?

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:33.300
I'm really glad I met you.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:38.550
I'm filled with nothing but gratitude towards you.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.100
Kuro...

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:49.610
I'm making a promise. I promise that I will not die before you, Keita-san.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:57.410
Therefore, Keita-san, make sure you keep yourself healthy and live for a long time.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:59.450
It's a promise.

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.210
Sure.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:52.170
Kuro...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.380
Keita-kun, good morning.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.510
A-Akane-san, I said you didn't need to come this morning.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.720
As it turns out, if I'm not doing what I always do, I get flustered.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.770
Keita-san, good morning.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.150
Good morning, Kuro.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.150
Where's Yakumo?

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.780
He had to go see Riona-chan for something.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:18.910
Seconds.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:19.780
Okay.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.290
I'm done.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.000
Punipuni, let's go for a walk.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:47.640
Hey, Kuro.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:02.240
Kuro... You...

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:07.750
I'm off.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.870
Be careful.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:32.770
Keita-kun?

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.690
What's wrong?

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:39.190
No, it's nothing.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.270
Your accommodation is appreciated.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:10.600
You're going back?

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:14.350
There does not seem to be anything left for me to record.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.750
I'll... Never see... Again...

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:42.880
I...

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.890
Keita-san, I really...

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.200
Keita-san...

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.170
Kuro...

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:27.130
Keita-san...

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.650
Synchro...

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.830
I'll be taking my leave now.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.870
Make sure you protect the princess properly.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.330
Starting this spring, I'll also be a sparkling university student.

00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.630
I have to start on a new path.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:01.880
Riona-san...

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.630
Come on, hurry up and go.

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:19.150
Ikutsu no Yori wo Koete Mezame wo Izanau Kaze

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:19.150
The wind that calls for awakening has crossed countless nights to reach us.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:20.730
The Masagami's curse faded away after being shouldered by a lone female Mototsumitama.

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:30.240
As it thaws my frozen body, before we realize it, dawn arrives.

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:30.240
Itsu Shika Asa wo Mukae Itetsuku Karada Tokete

00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:26.740
Even after seeing someone with the same face, people no longer faced their end.

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:32.200
In order for the curse to never befall humans again,

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:41.670
I've returned from my untimely death with my awakened memories.

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:41.670
Sameta Kioku de Hayasugita Shi wo Kaeshite

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:39.210
she forever isolated herself from the world by choosing to seal herself in the Sacred Precincts.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:54.060
The sounds of the bugs weeping, the sounds of the birds dancing in flight...

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:54.060
Mushitachi no Naku Koe mo Toritachi no Mau Haoto ni mo

00:22:54.060 --> 00:23:10.450
This soundless, white wasteland will be overflowing with their vivid colors.

00:22:54.060 --> 00:23:10.450
Oto wo Nakushita Shiroki Kare Chi ni Afureru Iro wo Sosoide Iku Azayaka ni

00:22:57.310 --> 00:22:59.560
Fate, huh...
